    <item>
      <title>Version 1.5.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0530</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.5.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>Apps stay in the VPN</h3>
        <p>Quitting an app used to quietly take it out of the VPN. Now the switch is a lasting choice: open the app again from anywhere and it rejoins the tunnel on its own.</p>
        <h3>No more vanishing into the menu bar</h3>
        <p>If your menu bar is full, macOS hides the newest icon without saying so. VPNonly now opens in a window with a Dock icon instead of looking like it failed to launch.</p>
        <h3>Updates install themselves</h3>
        <p>From here on, updates install with one click and macOS won't ask you to approve the app again.</p>
        <p><a href="https://vpnonly.app/changelog.html">Full changelog</a></p>
      ]]></description>
